In this video, we walk through how Route Optimization works in Fieldd.

You’ll learn how routes are automatically optimized, how to create a route service, what customers see when booking, how workers use routes in the Worker App, and how administrators can track route progress in real time.

Route Optimization helps you organize your team’s day more efficiently by automatically mapping out the most efficient order for scheduled jobs. Reducing travel time and saving fuel.

In this walkthrough, you’ll learn how to:
➡️ Activate Route Optimization
➡️ Create and publish a route service
➡️ Understand the customer booking experience
➡️ Use routes inside the Worker App
➡️ Track route progress as an administrator

By the end of this video, you’ll be ready to create a test route and confidently roll it out to your team.

